  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "新興商業問題研究",
    "sub_ename": "STUDIES ON EMERGING BUSINESS ISSUES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要探討新興商業問題以及商業發展趨勢分析。商業經營環境不斷改變，企業面臨重大衝擊，藉由新興商業問題之研究，有助於協助企業解決問題，發展適切的商業模式，以利企業永續經營。",
    "describe_eh": "This course discuss studies on emerging business issues and analyze the business development trend. The business environment is constantly changing, which has a major impact on firm. Through studies of emerging business issues, could help company to solve the business problem. And create new business models for sustainable operation in the future.",
